"""The five marketplace problems: one planted bug each, on the same clean codebase.

Each bug recreates a pattern seen in real systems, moved to this domain so the
original project cannot be recognised. tools/build_market_examples.py turns
each entry into examples/readcode-NNN. Never shipped to candidates.

Fields: mutation (the bug: main hunk, recorded in the manifest) and extra
(hunks that come with it, e.g. an import the buggy code no longer needs, so no
dead code gives it away); gate (the test that must fail on the bug).
"""

